{"date":"2005-12-30","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/f5/de/103161_QHBgR.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/f5/de/103161_QHBgR.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/f5/de/103161_QHBgR.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/f5/de/103161_QHBgR.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/f5/de/103161_QHBgR.jpg"},"summary":"很久以前，天下有一位叫女娲的女神。她使用光明之土和光明之水创造了自己的孩子――龙娃、凤娃，用凡土和水创造了人类。可是由于天层破裂，女娲为了天下苍生，用五色石补天，无奈中把龙娃和凤娃补上了天。于是母子相隔天地……\r\n百年后，天完好无缺。可是邪恶侵袭人间，人类面临危机。女娲遭受邪恶所迫被困“绝世界”。她只能用眼泪哭诉天下之危机，她的泪水变成了一条河，后人称“母亲河”又叫黄河。而龙凤双娃终于学成本领，获得天界神剑，重返天下。他们沿着黄河寻找他们的母亲，并同邪恶之势进行勇敢斗争……\r\n本片取材中国民间传说，描述传说中女娲创造出的龙娃、凤娃勇斗黑怪的曲折过程。民族自强的重要。","name":"东方神娃","name_cn":"东方神娃","tags":[{"name":"国产","count":160,"total_count":159897},{"name":"童年","count":126,"total_count":92590},{"name":"TV","count":82,"total_count":1391564},{"name":"2005","count":55,"total_count":23308},{"name":"奇幻","count":43,"total_count":464328},{"name":"原创","count":32,"total_count":614608},{"name":"电视","count":15,"total_count":560},{"name":"2005年","count":14,"total_count":1251},{"name":"cctv","count":14,"total_count":147},{"name":"中国","count":11,"total_count":31162},{"name":"TV（集数50-99）","count":10,"total_count":97},{"name":"没看全","count":8,"total_count":1806},{"name":"战斗","count":6,"total_count":465593},{"name":"无锡天龙动画有限公司","count":5,"total_count":5},{"name":"中推","count":3,"total_count":715},{"name":"剧集","count":3,"total_count":4319},{"name":"童年补完计划","count":2,"total_count":272},{"name":"国产动画","count":2,"total_count":5616},{"name":"TVA-01","count":2,"total_count":55},{"name":"子供向","count":2,"total_count":12581},{"name":"江苏省盛世影视文化有限公司","count":2,"total_count":2},{"name":"亲情","count":1,"total_count":5424},{"name":"其它","count":1,"total_count":917},{"name":"留念","count":1,"total_count":32},{"name":"神话","count":1,"total_count":1569},{"name":"2005年12月","count":1,"total_count":96},{"name":"兄妹","count":1,"total_count":7616},{"name":"励志","count":1,"total_count":